OL,3,GNEWSAHospital whistleblowers 'still
OL,4,Apenalised', staff claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo porters who won an employment
OL,7,Ftribunal against the Countess of
OL,8,FChester Hospital Trust said their
OL,9,Fvictory shows whistleblowers are "still
OL,10,Fpenalised".
OL,12,FLast month, the trust said its culture
OL,13,Fhad "improved" after the Thirlwall
OL,14,FInquiry found former bosses had
OL,15,F"intended to punish" doctors who raised
OL,16,Fconcerns about nurse Lucy Letby.
