OL,3,GNEWSAHospital whistleblowers 'still
OL,4,Apenalised', staff claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tribunal this year found porters John
OL,7,FCrayton and Thomas Jones had been
OL,8,F"inappropriately interrogated" after
OL,9,Fraising concerns about the way deceased
OL,10,Fpatients were transported. The pair
OL,11,Fsaid the ruling showed they had been
OL,12,F"unlawfully victimised".
OL,14,FThe trust said it accepted the
OL,15,Ftribunal's findings but "encourages all
OL,16,Fcolleagues to speak up".
